OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fwindy across the northwest of the UK,
OL,7,Fwith further showers, these merging
OL,8,Ftogether for a time to give a longer
OL,9,Fspell of rain. Drier with clear spells
OL,10,Ftowards the southeast, winds easing a
OL,11,Flittle but staying breezy.
