OL,13,CWednesday:FShowers tending to become
OL,14,Fconfined to Scotland as high pressure
OL,15,Fbuilds from the south. Dry and bright
OL,16,Ffor most, with sunny spells and
OL,17,Flighter winds. Temperatures a little
OL,18,Fabove average.
